4. Finally, leave Sunset District at 15:27 for Golden Gate Park (11 minutes travel) arriving at 15:38. Although Michelle’s window begins at 18:15, waiting is acceptable; then meet her for 90 minutes from 18:15–19:45, well within her 18:15–20:45 window.

